{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Black Screen": 2,
    "Paimon": 15,
    "Player": 17,
    "Sabbah": 68,
    "Ziyad": 3
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7319301",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "731930101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "731930101": {
            "id": "731930101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziyad",
            "text": "♪Rose, oh rose, grant me my wish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930102"
            ]
          },
          "731930102": {
            "id": "731930102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziyad",
            "text": "♪Blooming from a stone, the Golden Rose sang to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930103"
            ]
          },
          "731930103": {
            "id": "731930103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziyad",
            "text": "♪She sang...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930104"
            ]
          },
          "731930104": {
            "id": "731930104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's a local Sumeru folk song called the \"Singing Rose,\" right? It's such a cute song.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930105"
            ]
          },
          "731930105": {
            "id": "731930105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Too bad the boy ran off halfway through. Paimon would have loved to hear the whole thing and say hi to him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930106"
            ]
          },
          "731930106": {
            "id": "731930106",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "You must be new here. First time in Aaru Village?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930108",
              "731930110"
            ]
          },
          "731930108": {
            "id": "731930108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "No wonder you've never heard of that folk song.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930111"
            ]
          },
          "731930111": {
            "id": "731930111",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Well then, are you scholars looking to study abroad in Sumeru? I know that there are many foreign scholars in the Akademiya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930112"
            ]
          },
          "731930112": {
            "id": "731930112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We do know a lot of scholars, but we aren't quite like them ourselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930113"
            ]
          },
          "731930113": {
            "id": "731930113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Technically, we're adventurers, the glorious world-trotting duo — Paimon and {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930114"
            ]
          },
          "731930114": {
            "id": "731930114",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "World-trotting? Hahaha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930115"
            ]
          },
          "731930115": {
            "id": "731930115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's so funny? We're super famous adventurers, believe it or not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930116"
            ]
          },
          "731930116": {
            "id": "731930116",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "No, I wasn't mocking you, friends from faraway. Just the opposite. It's a delight to hear uplifting stories like people traveling the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930117"
            ]
          },
          "731930117": {
            "id": "731930117",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "When you're as detached from the world as I am, such enthusiastic remarks can really catch you off guard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930118"
            ]
          },
          "731930118": {
            "id": "731930118",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I'm sorry if I offended you. My name is Sabbah. I offer you my apologies as well as my welcome to the village.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930119"
            ]
          },
          "731930119": {
            "id": "731930119",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Ah yes. Were you talking about the rose folk song that Ziyad was singing?"
          },
          "731930110": {
            "id": "731930110",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Huh? Did I guess wrong? Let me think again..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7319302",
      "subQuestName": "Use the power of Dendro to \"fertilize\" the seeds",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7319305",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sabbah",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "731930901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "731930901": {
            "id": "731930901",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Can you wield Dendro? Are you someone with a Vision?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930902"
            ]
          },
          "731930902": {
            "id": "731930902",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I haven't met anyone like that in a long time. What a nostalgic feeling...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930903"
            ]
          },
          "731930903": {
            "id": "731930903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It should be fine now, right, Miss Sabbah?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930904"
            ]
          },
          "731930904": {
            "id": "731930904",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "That's right, they should sprout soon if powered by Dendro. Let's just wait for a while...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930905"
            ]
          },
          "731930905": {
            "id": "731930905",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Gradually, sprouts begin peeking out of the soil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930906"
            ]
          },
          "731930906": {
            "id": "731930906",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "They stop growing after sprouting a few leaves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930907"
            ]
          },
          "731930907": {
            "id": "731930907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#They're sprouting! Paimon knew you could do just about anything, {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930908"
            ]
          },
          "731930908": {
            "id": "731930908",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "The results were immediate, as I thought... Thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930909"
            ]
          },
          "731930909": {
            "id": "731930909",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Too bad there are no flowers yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930910"
            ]
          },
          "731930910": {
            "id": "731930910",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Oh, that's normal. You can't rush such things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930911"
            ]
          },
          "731930911": {
            "id": "731930911",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Plants have to go through stages of growth. That you were able to make them sprout is already quite amazing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930912"
            ]
          },
          "731930912": {
            "id": "731930912",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Give the roses some more time to take in the nourishment. It will be better for them as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930913"
            ]
          },
          "731930913": {
            "id": "731930913",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I'm very grateful to you as it is. I wouldn't wish to bother you further.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930914"
            ]
          },
          "731930914": {
            "id": "731930914",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Just drop by and see them in your spare time. That would be enough."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7319308",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "731930501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "731930501": {
            "id": "731930501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "If it weren't for you, I don't think I'd have ever seen these roses sprout.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930502"
            ]
          },
          "731930502": {
            "id": "731930502",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "If only I knew this would happen... instead of seeds, I should have brought a few more books.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930504",
              "731930520"
            ]
          },
          "731930504": {
            "id": "731930504",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Are you surprised? Well, I guess that means that I've adapted pretty well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930505"
            ]
          },
          "731930505": {
            "id": "731930505",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "When I first got here, I was unable to get used to anything, whether it be the food, the housing, or anything else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930506"
            ]
          },
          "731930506": {
            "id": "731930506",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "But I got used to everything over time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930507"
            ]
          },
          "731930507": {
            "id": "731930507",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "That doesn't mean that I've fully accepted my predicament, though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930508"
            ]
          },
          "731930508": {
            "id": "731930508",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I suppose it is impossible to make roses from Sumeru City bloom here after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930509"
            ]
          },
          "731930509": {
            "id": "731930509",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you a researcher?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930510"
            ]
          },
          "731930510": {
            "id": "731930510",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I could have been called that once, but not anymore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930511"
            ]
          },
          "731930511": {
            "id": "731930511",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I said something beyond my station, and learned something I shouldn't have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930512"
            ]
          },
          "731930512": {
            "id": "731930512",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I broke the Akademiya's taboos, so I was removed from amongst their ranks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930513"
            ]
          },
          "731930513": {
            "id": "731930513",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What did you say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930514"
            ]
          },
          "731930514": {
            "id": "731930514",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Curiosity is the impetus for seeking wisdom, but it's also the cause of sin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930515"
            ]
          },
          "731930515": {
            "id": "731930515",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I only understood that after I was exiled to this place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930516"
            ]
          },
          "731930516": {
            "id": "731930516",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "For safety reasons, I don't think I should go into details.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930517"
            ]
          },
          "731930517": {
            "id": "731930517",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "All right then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930518"
            ]
          },
          "731930518": {
            "id": "731930518",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Ahem, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930535"
            ]
          },
          "731930535": {
            "id": "731930535",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I thought adventurers would just come and go, never coming back to chit-chat after finishing their jobs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930536"
            ]
          },
          "731930536": {
            "id": "731930536",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I didn't expect to have another long conversation with you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930537"
            ]
          },
          "731930537": {
            "id": "731930537",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "To be honest, I don't have a lot of friends to talk to here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930538"
            ]
          },
          "731930538": {
            "id": "731930538",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Do you think... at some point... you would be able to come by and fertilize my plants again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930539"
            ]
          },
          "731930539": {
            "id": "731930539",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930540"
            ]
          },
          "731930540": {
            "id": "731930540",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "...Okay then, I'll wait for you."
          },
          "731930520": {
            "id": "731930520",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "You probably don't know much about them... but they are very versatile, and have many uses.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930521"
            ]
          },
          "731930521": {
            "id": "731930521",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "They can be eaten, turned into medicine, given as gifts, or fetch a good price on the market.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930522"
            ]
          },
          "731930522": {
            "id": "731930522",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "And that's just some of the more common applications.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930523"
            ]
          },
          "731930523": {
            "id": "731930523",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "The flower, leaves, and stalk of a Sumeru Rose also did not always look like this. They all had different appearances once upon a time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930524"
            ]
          },
          "731930524": {
            "id": "731930524",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I believe geographical changes led to changes in the roses' traits.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930525"
            ]
          },
          "731930525": {
            "id": "731930525",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "A study of its traits could help us derive past geographical and historical information.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930526"
            ]
          },
          "731930526": {
            "id": "731930526",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I won't be able to explain the mechanism over just a casual conversation, and sharing such information with adventurers is probably against the rules as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930527"
            ]
          },
          "731930527": {
            "id": "731930527",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "If you're interested in botanical evolution, you should visit the Akademiya. They'll have more on the subject.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930528"
            ]
          },
          "731930528": {
            "id": "731930528",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, you're doing this for your research?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930529"
            ]
          },
          "731930529": {
            "id": "731930529",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I'm not a researcher anymore. I no longer have the right or means to pursue any research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930530"
            ]
          },
          "731930530": {
            "id": "731930530",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "If you must know why... *sigh*, you are a very curious soul, you know that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930531"
            ]
          },
          "731930531": {
            "id": "731930531",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I grew a lot of Sumeru Roses back in my former residence. The flowers were spectacular, and I got to see them every day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930532"
            ]
          },
          "731930532": {
            "id": "731930532",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "If it was possible, I wish I could see them again, just like before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930533"
            ]
          },
          "731930533": {
            "id": "731930533",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "...That's all there is to it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731930534"
            ]
          },
          "731930534": {
            "id": "731930534",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I can understand that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7319307",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "731930701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "731930701": {
            "id": "731930701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Do you really have a way to grow roses through the power of <color=#00E1FFFF>Dendro</color>?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}